--
-- What it does:
--   Visuals  - player, loot, animal, resource and water ESP built from the game's own
--              attributes (CombatStats, Highlightable loot, Wildlife species).
--   Survival - live hunger/thirst/oxygen/health readout plus auto eat, drink, heal and
--              craft through the game's own server calls (ConsumeItem / CraftItem).
--   Combat   - aim assist with FOV circle; shots are redirected by patching the game's
--              CameraRig.aimPoint, the same function the game uses to build ShotFired.
--   World    - phase, alive count, barrier timer, disasters, nearest water, map info.
--
-- Everything client side. Health, hunger, inventory and the AntiCheat are server owned,
-- so the hub never fakes values: movement cheats are deliberately absent because the
-- game rewrites WalkSpeed and counts strikes.

